1
00:00:00,653 --> 00:00:05,962
foroys mit undzer intervyu. yetst haltn mir bay kasete n- tsvey.

2
00:00:02,567 --> 00:00:02,954
ye

3
00:00:06,070 --> 00:00:11,969
bite, dertseylt vayter vos iz geshen in STRZEGOWO.

4
00:00:10,394 --> 00:00:13,601
yo, zenen, zenen mir geganen nokh STRZEGOWO,

5
00:00:13,601 --> 00:00:15,699
⟨iz men⟩ gekumen far STRZEGOWO

6
00:00:16,498 --> 00:00:20,795
hobn ⟨di⟩ politsey, yo, ⟨mir⟩ geganen azoy tsu tsvey.

7
00:00:21,595 --> 00:00:24,010
ikh bin geganen mit eyn tokhter

8
00:00:24,010 --> 00:00:28,331
un di tsveyte tokhter iz geb- iz geganen ⟨vider⟩ mit di kuzine

9
00:00:28,331 --> 00:00:33,452
fun mayn shvester's tokhter di el- di di amerika- di daytsh- fun Daytshland

10
00:00:34,065 --> 00:00:36,320
un, un di meydl iz geganen.

11
00:00:36,343 --> 00:00:39,378
zey zenen geganen azoy yede tsu tsvey

12
00:00:39,384 --> 00:00:43,576
az me zol undz UNK fardekhtikn. dos iz geven in a zuntik

13
00:00:43,735 --> 00:00:49,604
dervayl zenen ongeforn di VOLKSDEUTSCHEN hobn zey gezen epes hot zey nisht ⟨gefeln⟩ di geshikhte.

14
00:00:49,604 --> 00:00:55,207
vos epes ⟨vos⟩ ge- ikh bin nisht gegangen di dem rikhtung fun dem kirkh.

15
00:00:55,207 --> 00:00:57,937
mir hobn mir geganen di rikhtung fun di geto

16
00:00:59,158 --> 00:01:02,544
un zey gezen az s'iz nisht, az s'iz yidishe kinder,

17
00:01:02,601 --> 00:01:05,230
zenen zey arop un zey hobn zey farhaltn.

18
00:01:05,230 --> 00:01:08,703
ikh bin adurkhgeganen mit mayn tokhter.

19
00:01:09,047 --> 00:01:12,230
un mayn shvester iz oykh adrukhgeganen.

20
00:01:12,861 --> 00:01:15,549
ir mame iz oykhet adurkhgeganen mit di kinder.

21
00:01:15,549 --> 00:01:18,047
dort yene kinder zenen geblibn.

22
00:01:18,047 --> 00:01:20,888
di meydl vos mayn shvester hot genumen

23
00:01:21,248 --> 00:01:22,693
tsu zikh

24
00:01:23,644 --> 00:01:25,910
un di di fun Daytshland.

25
00:01:25,855 --> 00:01:27,249
di tokhter ire.

26
00:01:25,910 --> 00:01:27,598
⟨un di di⟩ oykhet

27
00:01:27,598 --> 00:01:29,520
un m'ho-, m'hot zey arayngenumen

28
00:01:29,520 --> 00:01:31,569
dortn in a keler arayn

29
00:01:31,569 --> 00:01:32,919
un m'hot ⟨zey hot⟩ bazukht,

30
00:01:33,398 --> 00:01:34,944
u- unterzukht.

31
00:01:35,254 --> 00:01:36,598
iz azoy geven.

32
00:01:36,807 --> 00:01:39,588
mayn tokhter, di andere

33
00:01:39,588 --> 00:01:42,060
geven a yingere ober ⟨z'iz⟩ nisht, ⟨z'iz⟩ nisht ⟨geve-⟩

34
00:01:42,060 --> 00:01:44,692
ah z'iz geven a moyredike un zi iz nisht geven key-

35
00:01:44,692 --> 00:01:47,667
z'iz geven enlekh tsu a yidishe, nisht tsu keyn kristlekhe.

36
00:01:48,535 --> 00:01:50,723
un zi hot gevust az zi hot

37
00:01:51,555 --> 00:01:53,557
gelt ayngenadt

38
00:01:54,407 --> 00:01:56,454
hot men zi gefregt: "vos hot es?

39
00:01:56,454 --> 00:02:02,096
vu geyt es?". hobn zey gezogt "me geyt dos, me hot do mishpokhe, geyt men tsu di mishpokhe"

40
00:02:02,136 --> 00:02:04,174
"du veyst az me tor nisht do geyn?"

41
00:02:04,174 --> 00:02:05,673
m'hot nisht gevust!

42
00:02:05,933 --> 00:02:09,659
un zi hot... me hot geshlogn iz zi zol UNK vu zey hobn dos gelt

43
00:02:09,659 --> 00:02:10,696
hobn zey,

44
00:02:10,696 --> 00:02:14,769
me hot zey geshlogn, me hot zey geshlogn ober zey hobn nisht oysgezogt.

45
00:02:14,961 --> 00:02:19,413
zi hot nisht oysgezogt, zi hot nit, zi hot gevust az me hot un zi hot nisht oysgezogt.

46
00:02:19,413 --> 00:02:20,321
iz shoyn.

47
00:02:21,285 --> 00:02:25,532
ah undz, undz hot men vider gezen fun hintn az me hot zey farhaltn, az iz men

48
00:02:25,532 --> 00:02:28,272
arayn in di geto un me hot dos gemoldn.

49
00:02:28,272 --> 00:02:31,444
un iz geven a UNK fun di yidishe politsey.

50
00:02:31,444 --> 00:02:33,449
iz me geganen zey aroysnemen.

51
00:02:34,603 --> 00:02:37,037
undz zenen geganen take. me hot zi aroysgenumen

52
00:02:37,037 --> 00:02:39,916
zey hobn, me hot zi gut geshlogn. m'hot zi geshlogn, m'hot di

53
00:02:39,916 --> 00:02:43,966
di tokhter fun Daytshland vos iz geven hot gekrign gut geshlogn.

54
00:02:43,966 --> 00:02:45,240
un di meydl

55
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:49,920
zi oykh gekrign. ale hobn gekrign geshlogn ober zey hobn zey aroysgenumen

56
00:02:50,584 --> 00:02:53,713
⟨undz iz men⟩, iz azoy iz men shoyn gevezn in di geto in

57
00:02:53,385 --> 00:02:54,324
in STRZEGOWO?

58
00:02:54,118 --> 00:02:55,588
in STRZEGOWO.

59
00:02:55,528 --> 00:02:58,070
⟨vu ir⟩ hot zikh gelebt in dem geto in STRZEGOWO?

60
00:02:57,098 --> 00:02:59,887
un di geto in STRZEGOWO iz azoy gevezn:

61
00:02:59,887 --> 00:03:04,077
di k- ki- kristn hobn gehat di erloybenish tsu nemen zikh

62
00:03:04,523 --> 00:03:09,411
vayl tayere kinder, di kristn's kinder, di sh- di groyse

63
00:03:09,417 --> 00:03:13,725
hot men genumen tsu der arbet un iz geblibn bloyz di eltere mentshn.

64
00:03:13,725 --> 00:03:16,686
hobn zey gehat dos rekht tsu nemen

65
00:03:16,686 --> 00:03:21,225
fun di yidn arbeters, zoln geyn.

66
00:03:21,225 --> 00:03:23,782
iz gekumen tsu mir eyner oykhet

67
00:03:23,782 --> 00:03:26,895
vos hot gekent dem krist far di milkhome

68
00:03:26,895 --> 00:03:30,065
un hot gezogt az er vil hobn aza froy.

69
00:03:30,291 --> 00:03:33,559
⟨hot⟩ zikh ⟨ikh⟩ gey arbetn. zog ikh "yo, far vos nisht".

70
00:03:33,784 --> 00:03:36,067
un ikh bin geganen tsu dem goy arbetn,

71
00:03:36,067 --> 00:03:39,802
di froy iz gelegn paralizhirt in bet.

72
00:03:39,927 --> 00:03:42,784
hot zi ge-, hot er mikh aroy- dort genumen.

73
00:03:42,784 --> 00:03:45,456
un ikh hob dort gearbet bay dem goy.

74
00:03:46,575 --> 00:03:49,370
un andere oykhet, hobn oykhet gearbet.

75
00:03:49,495 --> 00:03:53,639
un mayn shvester iz zi geblibn mit di kinder.

76
00:03:54,388 --> 00:03:58,157
di shtelt aykh for, ah ikh hob gekont epes tsuganvenen.

77
00:03:58,157 --> 00:03:59,853
az zoln nisht visn

78
00:03:59,853 --> 00:04:04,316
di goyim. kh'hob getun ales ah ikh zol kon epes zey helfn.

79
00:04:04,316 --> 00:04:06,881
un dos, vos ikh hob oykh gekont tsu helfn

80
00:04:06,881 --> 00:04:09,235
mit a fleshele milkh far a kind.

81
00:04:09,235 --> 00:04:11,696
tsu gebn a tropn milkh ⟨tsu⟩ mit epes

82
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:17,707
iz di goyim hobn oykh nisht ge- gekont geyn, zey torn nisht ⟨getort⟩ geyn

83
00:04:17,707 --> 00:04:19,942
ikh hob es nisht getort vider aheymshlepn.

84
00:04:19,942 --> 00:04:22,026
s'iz geven efsher tsvey kilometer

85
00:04:22,026 --> 00:04:24,279
ober kh'hob opgepast a tsayt

86
00:04:24,279 --> 00:04:27,806
vos zey hobn nisht gezen. vi ⟨un⟩ ikh veys nisht vi ikh hob getun.

87
00:04:27,806 --> 00:04:31,400
kh'hob opgeshikt a shtikele broyt, kh'hob genumen a fleshele milkh.

88
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:35,552
kh'hob genumen vos kh'⟨hon-⟩ kh'hob gekent epes ⟨zikh⟩ UNK ahingetrogn.

89
00:04:35,552 --> 00:04:38,792
dos hobn zikh azoy ⟨hobn⟩ zikh

90
00:04:38,792 --> 00:04:39,962
zey hobn ge-

91
00:04:40,035 --> 00:04:42,858
zey keyn esn derfun hobn zey nisht gehat

92
00:04:42,858 --> 00:04:45,483
ober epes beser vi gornisht.

93
00:04:45,483 --> 00:04:48,231
demolt iz shoyn nisht geven tsu koyfn nisht geven.

94
00:04:48,557 --> 00:04:50,173
s'iz nisht geven vos tsu koyfn,

95
00:04:50,173 --> 00:04:52,589
me hot dos nisht ⟨gedult⟩ iz UNK bay a kleyne

96
00:04:52,589 --> 00:04:54,677
geto, me hot nisht getort aroysgeyn.

97
00:04:54,679 --> 00:04:57,646
un dos vos me hot gegebn, dos hot gemuzt zayn genung.

98
00:04:58,041 --> 00:05:00,904
un vos hot men gegebn in geto? vos flegt men gebn?

99
00:04:59,577 --> 00:05:01,410
vos hobn zey gegebn?

100
00:05:01,686 --> 00:05:04,267
kh- ⟨gleybt mir⟩, ikh veys gornisht vos zey hobn gegebn vayl

101
00:05:04,267 --> 00:05:06,962
ikh bin dokh nisht gevezn, iz ikh bin dokh geven bay di goyim.

102
00:05:08,554 --> 00:05:10,499
kh'veys nisht vos zey hobn gegebn.

103
00:05:10,499 --> 00:05:12,854
vos hobn, ikh gedenk nisht vos zey hobn shoyn gegebn.

104
00:05:12,854 --> 00:05:16,777
efsher ⟨undz⟩ zey gegebn a tsuteylung fun broyt, efsher undz epes gegebn.

105
00:05:16,777 --> 00:05:19,619
kh'veys zey hobn nisht gehat. di kinder hobn gelitn noyt.

106
00:05:19,619 --> 00:05:21,660
dos veys ikh, az zey hobn ale gelitn noyt.

107
00:05:21,835 --> 00:05:24,377
eyn mol hot men a zuntik fregt der goy

108
00:05:24,450 --> 00:05:27,616
bay zey UNK geharget an of.

109
00:05:27,758 --> 00:05:28,832
ahin

110
00:05:28,956 --> 00:05:32,814
hakn zey avek di fislekh, zey nitsn nisht dem kop.

111
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:36,208
zey, zey UNK ikh bin dokh geven di baleboste dort.

112
00:05:36,208 --> 00:05:38,386
ikh hob dokh dos alts geroymt di

113
00:05:38,386 --> 00:05:42,824
avekgeley- hob ikh aroysgenumen di fislekh, ikh hob aroysgenumen dem kop

114
00:05:42,824 --> 00:05:44,779
vos zey hobn nisht genitst.

115
00:05:44,953 --> 00:05:47,799
kh'hob dokh oykh nisht gevolt az zey zoln visn.

116
00:05:48,261 --> 00:05:50,010
un ikh hob dos bahaltn.

117
00:05:50,067 --> 00:05:53,700
un dos hob ikh ah hob ikh ahingetrogn.

118
00:05:53,700 --> 00:05:56,220
un mayn shvester hot derfun gemakht a mitog.

119
00:05:57,171 --> 00:05:58,886
mit a por kartofl

120
00:05:58,892 --> 00:06:00,458
hot zi gemakht a mitog.

121
00:06:00,458 --> 00:06:02,278
dos hobn di kinder gehat af a mitog.

122
00:06:02,470 --> 00:06:05,417
azoy hot gedoyert efsher a dray khadoshim.

123
00:06:05,541 --> 00:06:09,129
nakher hot men gezogt az ⟨m'et shoyn⟩ do aroysshikn fun di geto oykhet,

124
00:06:09,507 --> 00:06:11,239
me zol undz tsugreytn.

125
00:06:11,245 --> 00:06:15,761
yo, un durkh der tsayt hot men gen- tsuzamengenumen mit tsen yidn

126
00:06:15,852 --> 00:06:18,478
un me hot zey ale tsu eyn yidn oyfgehongen.

127
00:06:18,366 --> 00:06:19,577
in STRZEGOWO?

128
00:06:19,338 --> 00:06:20,377
in STRZEGOWO.

129
00:06:20,008 --> 00:06:21,447
far vos? far simkhes?

130
00:06:20,808 --> 00:06:23,012
far gornisht, vayl s'iz di shpyonen.

131
00:06:23,012 --> 00:06:27,357
s'iz d- d- zey zey trogn tsu tsu di tsu di rusn.

132
00:06:27,357 --> 00:06:29,182
trogn dos yedie-nayes,

133
00:06:29,182 --> 00:06:31,449
UNK shpyo- ⟨zey⟩ shpyonirn far di rusn.

134
00:06:31,449 --> 00:06:34,391
un me hot genumen tsen yidn me hot oyfgehongen.

135
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:37,912
un ale hobn gemuzt, ale yidn ⟨hot men⟩ gemuzt shteyn

136
00:06:37,912 --> 00:06:39,234
un dos kukn.

137
00:06:39,234 --> 00:06:42,229
un keyner hot nisht getort veynen, me hot nisht getort gornisht.

138
00:06:42,234 --> 00:06:47,160
di kinder zenen ⟨geshtanen⟩ un ⟨zaynen⟩ gezen vi me hot dayn foter oyfgehongen,

139
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:50,743
a bruder oyfgehongen, tsen yidn, s'iz dos gedenkt zikh.

140
00:06:51,070 --> 00:06:55,012
dos gedenkt zi oykhet, vi me hot di tsen yidn oyfgehongen.

141
00:06:55,221 --> 00:06:57,695
ikh bin gekumen tsu loyfn fun dorf.

142
00:06:59,153 --> 00:07:02,302
ikh hob zi gehaltn oyf der hant un zi gedenkt es.

143
00:07:02,494 --> 00:07:04,918
vi m'ot oyfgehongen di tsen yidn.

144
00:07:04,435 --> 00:07:07,247
ven iz dos geven? velkhe yor iz dos shoyn geven?

145
00:07:07,050 --> 00:07:08,478
dos iz gevezn

146
00:07:09,210 --> 00:07:11,634
ANFANG dray un UNK

147
00:07:11,929 --> 00:07:12,950
ANFANG dray

148
00:07:12,251 --> 00:07:16,134
dray un fertsik, ⟨ober⟩ s'iz shoyn geven dray un fertsik, kh'gedenk nisht genoy.

149
00:07:16,134 --> 00:07:18,401
tsi s'iz shoyn geven A- ANFANG

150
00:07:18,610 --> 00:07:21,834
tsi s'iz nokh, yo, s'hot gemuzt zayn ANFANG dray un fertsik

151
00:07:21,590 --> 00:07:22,634
ANFANG dray un fertsik

152
00:07:21,834 --> 00:07:25,503
⟨az me hot zey, me hot⟩ in STRZEGOWO oyfgehongen di tsen yidn.

153
00:07:26,710 --> 00:07:31,445
un azoy bin ikh bald bin ikh shoyn nisht tsu dem goy.

154
00:07:32,212 --> 00:07:33,603
nor ikh bin genumen

155
00:07:35,364 --> 00:07:39,714
un me hot zikh gemakht greyt me zol aroysgeyn. m'et geyn tsu goyim.

156
00:07:39,990 --> 00:07:43,323
der goy iz grade geven tsu mir gut, der goy iz geven gut

157
00:07:43,323 --> 00:07:47,476
ober zayn bay dem goy hob ikh nisht gekont. s'iz geven tsu noent tsum shtetl.

158
00:07:47,799 --> 00:07:51,771
ober kh'hob gezukht, kh'gedenk UNK ikh hob im nokh far tsayt er hot nokh

159
00:07:51,771 --> 00:07:54,880
⟨ge- o- lernt⟩, kh'hob nisht gekont melkn keyn ku.

160
00:07:54,884 --> 00:07:57,576
hot er mikh gelernt, zogt er "du muzst yo kenen.

161
00:07:57,576 --> 00:08:01,976
s'iz di ende nokh nisht di milkhome, ikh veys" zogt er, iz geven a kluger goy

162
00:08:01,976 --> 00:08:04,354
er iz geven ⟨a mol⟩ UNK Amerike

163
00:08:04,354 --> 00:08:09,776
zogt er: "ikh veys, az me zogt di milkhome vet zikh shnel endikn, ikh hob gezogt fun onheyb on

164
00:08:09,776 --> 00:08:12,193
az di milkhome vet gedoyern yorn.

165
00:08:12,193 --> 00:08:15,654
un du ⟨lern dikh⟩" hot mikh oysgelernt melkn di ki.

166
00:08:15,654 --> 00:08:17,750
dos iz mir shpeter gut tsu nits gekumen.

167
00:08:18,853 --> 00:08:21,783
bin ikh ober bay dem goy ⟨oykh⟩ nisht gekent zayn.

168
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:24,703
hob ikh un mayn shvester

169
00:08:24,777 --> 00:08:27,853
mit ire dray kinder un mayne tsvey kinder,

170
00:08:27,853 --> 00:08:30,457
di meydl iz geganen tsu ir mishpokhe,

171
00:08:30,582 --> 00:08:32,314
vos me hot mitgenumen,

172
00:08:32,725 --> 00:08:35,393
un mayn shvester's tokhter iz geganen avek

173
00:08:35,393 --> 00:08:38,316
mit a KHAVERA, z'iz shoyn nisht mer tsurikgekumen.

174
00:08:38,316 --> 00:08:41,899
zenen geganen geyn nokh Rusland, zenen beyde ⟨nisht⟩ tsurikgekumen.

175
00:08:42,259 --> 00:08:48,935
un bin ikh mit di, mit di kinder, mayne tsvey kinder, di shvester mit dray kinder

176
00:08:49,735 --> 00:08:51,039
UNK aroys

177
00:08:51,039 --> 00:08:52,766
mir zenen ale tsu goyim.

178
00:08:53,329 --> 00:08:57,476
s'iz nisht geven azoy laykht arayn tsu goyim, goyim hobn nisht gevolt araynlozn.

179
00:08:56,937 --> 00:08:59,254
s'iz geven BEKANNTE goyim oder stam?

180
00:08:58,471 --> 00:09:01,181
ABSOLUTNIE nisht, m'ot keynem ⟨hot men⟩ nisht gekent.

181
00:09:01,181 --> 00:09:02,384
gornisht

182
00:09:01,699 --> 00:09:02,891
in a dorf?

183
00:09:02,644 --> 00:09:03,974
in derfer, yo.

184
00:09:03,974 --> 00:09:05,507
un alts in derfer.

185
00:09:05,580 --> 00:09:09,101
a- a- avek, dos iz gornisht geven undzer gegnt.

186
00:09:08,483 --> 00:09:11,092
un di goyim ⟨zey⟩ hobn gevust az ir ⟨zent⟩ yidn?

187
00:09:10,898 --> 00:09:12,482
yo, zey hobn gevust,

188
00:09:12,482 --> 00:09:15,660
yo, zey hobn gevust, hobn zey aroysgeganen fun di geto, zey hobn gevust

189
00:09:15,660 --> 00:09:21,221
eyn goy grade, ⟨m'iz⟩ arayngegan tsu a goye hot zi undz nisht gelozt ibernekhtikn in di shtub.

190
00:09:21,221 --> 00:09:24,747
⟨s'hert zikh tsu⟩ z- ⟨nekhtikn⟩ oybn oyfn boydem

191
00:09:24,747 --> 00:09:28,021
zol zayn oyfn boydem UNK me zol iberkumen di nakht.

192
00:09:28,021 --> 00:09:31,437
un azoy iz me geganen, iz me geganen ahin un aher.

193
00:09:31,437 --> 00:09:34,698
⟨vi⟩ ikh veys nisht vifl teg un nekht iz men geganen

194
00:09:34,698 --> 00:09:37,164
biz me hot ayngeordnt di kinder

195
00:09:37,558 --> 00:09:42,074
bay goyim. un di shvester mayne, s'iz nisht geven laykht, s'iz geven zeyer

196
00:09:42,098 --> 00:09:44,865
zeyer shver, ikh v-, s'hot gedoyert a tsayt

197
00:09:44,865 --> 00:09:48,748
m'ot, m'ot keynmol hot nisht gevust ⟨vi⟩ ven di tsayt iz

