393
00:19:10,397 --> 00:19:13,085
hob ikh gezukht, gezukht, ⟨kholile⟩,

394
00:19:13,085 --> 00:19:14,154
gezukht,

395
00:19:14,683 --> 00:19:16,634
ikh bin arayn oykh tsu krist

396
00:19:18,953 --> 00:19:20,980
zi hot mir nisht azoy ⟨gefeln⟩

397
00:19:20,980 --> 00:19:24,262
hob ikh, hob ikh bald, zikh ⟨g- ah ⟩ vayter

398
00:19:25,450 --> 00:19:27,914
⟨un az dos⟩ hob ikh, bin ikh geblibn

399
00:19:27,914 --> 00:19:30,283
⟨hob ikh⟩ shoyn m'hot m'hot

400
00:19:29,097 --> 00:19:31,740
keyn, keyn dokumentn hobn zey nisht gefregt?

401
00:19:31,484 --> 00:19:36,388
kh'hob nisht gehat. kh'hob gehat epes a ⟨shtikl⟩ papir fun mayn ⟨tsad⟩ poylishe take KHAVERA

402
00:19:36,390 --> 00:19:40,361
ober kh'hob keyn mol nisht gehat ⟨ven dos hobn zey⟩ mikh fregn vegn a dokument

403
00:19:41,059 --> 00:19:42,286
keyn mol nisht.

404
00:19:42,286 --> 00:19:46,068
dem nomen take DUBLIKA, DUBLICKA hob ikh geheysn

405
00:19:46,068 --> 00:19:47,983
hob ikh gehat fun mayne a

406
00:19:47,983 --> 00:19:49,844
kristlekhe KHAVERA.

407
00:19:49,885 --> 00:19:53,931
hot mir gegebn, zi hot geheysn GENOWEFA DUBLICKA.

408
00:19:53,931 --> 00:19:55,982
hob ikh fun ir dos gekrign.

409
00:19:55,982 --> 00:19:58,479
kh'hob key- ober ikh hob es keyn mol nisht oysgenitst

410
00:19:58,479 --> 00:19:59,947
me hot ⟨mikh keyner hot⟩ nisht gefregt.

411
00:19:59,947 --> 00:20:03,176
ikh hob gehat mazl me hot mikh keyn mol UNK nisht UNK gekhapt

412
00:20:03,300 --> 00:20:07,669
kholile, keyn mol oyfn veg hob ikh nisht gehat me zol mikh, kholile, zatshepen

413
00:20:07,669 --> 00:20:11,572
ober vos, bay der nakht, keyn mol nisht.

414
00:20:12,537 --> 00:20:15,643
un vi hot ir zikh a eytse getun mit mit di ale modlitves,

415
00:20:15,643 --> 00:20:17,351
mit di ale ⟨zakhn⟩, ir hot alts gekent?

416
00:20:16,210 --> 00:20:19,157
ye, yo, kh'hob vos heyst, ikh hob

417
00:20:18,268 --> 00:20:20,287
zikh oysgelernt UNK

418
00:20:19,247 --> 00:20:22,830
kh'hob ikh hob es gekent fun di shul nokh, kh'hob yo gekent.

419
00:20:22,830 --> 00:20:25,842
ikh hob gekent dem UNK MODLITWY kh'hob nisht gekent BOŻE

420
00:20:25,842 --> 00:20:29,107
zi kh'hob gekent di lider, "BOŻE COŚ POLSKĘ".

421
00:20:29,107 --> 00:20:32,313
ikh gedenk nokh avade nokh fun di shul vos me hot gezungen

422
00:20:32,313 --> 00:20:35,283
mit di kristn, undz hot dokh ⟨gehat⟩ a

423
00:20:35,283 --> 00:20:36,921
nisht keyn yidishe shul

424
00:20:36,921 --> 00:20:38,894
bay undz iz dokh geven a kristlekhe shul

425
00:20:37,978 --> 00:20:38,696
POWSZECHNY

426
00:20:38,894 --> 00:20:41,722
a POWSZECHNY iz geven ⟨far⟩ yidn, a kritslekhe shul.

427
00:20:41,722 --> 00:20:46,089
hob ikh onge- UNK dos lebn bild, hob ikh, ⟨kholile⟩, geknit

428
00:20:46,264 --> 00:20:50,295
un ikh hob opgezogt, ikh hob gezogt vos hob ikh gezogt, ⟨hot⟩

429
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:51,591
un s'poylish hot ir geredt gut

430
00:20:52,373 --> 00:20:56,023
dos hot mir keyn mol nisht ge- keyner nisht UNK keyn mol.

431
00:20:56,023 --> 00:20:57,716
az kh'bin a yidish kind.

432
00:20:58,026 --> 00:21:01,860
bloyz az kh'bin geven in Daytshland oyf arbet UNK

433
00:21:00,557 --> 00:21:02,188
dos iz geven shpeter.

434
00:21:01,860 --> 00:21:04,034
ye, azoy keyn mol ⟨hot⟩ nisht

435
00:21:04,034 --> 00:21:05,495
keyner gornisht, NAH.

436
00:21:06,565 --> 00:21:09,461
iz vi lang hot zikh azoy getsoygn bizn ⟨sheft⟩?

437
00:21:09,197 --> 00:21:11,936
dos gesheft hot zikh getsoygn zeyer lang

438
00:21:11,936 --> 00:21:13,106
biz

439
00:21:14,057 --> 00:21:16,329
biz

440
00:21:17,618 --> 00:21:21,049
s'iz shoyn geven zeyer shlekht, yo, ⟨naher⟩ ikh bin geganen,

441
00:21:21,049 --> 00:21:22,559
bin ikh geven bay ⟨a⟩ goy

442
00:21:22,559 --> 00:21:27,112
hot mir oykh a bakante fun maynem a man vos mayn man hot mit im gehandlt

443
00:21:27,118 --> 00:21:30,672
hot er mikh zeyer gut oyfgenumen, zeyer gut!

444
00:21:29,532 --> 00:21:31,718
er hot shoyn yo gevust ver ir UNK?

445
00:21:30,679 --> 00:21:32,420
er hot gevust, az ikh bin yo

446
00:21:32,420 --> 00:21:34,286
er iz gevust ver ikh bin, zogt er

447
00:21:34,286 --> 00:21:36,496
"far vos hostu mir nisht" dos zogt er "gezogt?

448
00:21:36,496 --> 00:21:42,480
ikh volt far der milkhome far enk oy- oysgeboyt a a a SCHRON" zogt er.

449
00:21:39,730 --> 00:21:41,192
SCHRON

450
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:45,492
"un voltst geven mit a man, voltst geven mit di kinder"

451
00:21:45,492 --> 00:21:49,538
neyn, s'iz geven tsu noent fun undzer shtot, me hot me hot dos nisht gekent ⟨tun⟩.

452
00:21:49,538 --> 00:21:52,628
dort bin ikh geven bay dem goy zeyer gut.

453
00:21:52,628 --> 00:21:55,859
oykhet a baleboste dort, s'iz geven etlekhe kinder,

454
00:21:55,859 --> 00:21:58,692
kh'hob zey gefirt in bet, ⟨dos⟩ zenen geven ⟨tseflign⟩

455
00:21:58,692 --> 00:22:02,803
un fun dem goy undz hot zikh ongehoybn tsu makhn zeyer shver.

456
00:22:03,467 --> 00:22:07,227
UNK yeder tir oyfgeshtanen oyfgeshribn

457
00:22:07,227 --> 00:22:09,570
a tsetl vifl mentshn es voynen.

458
00:22:11,061 --> 00:22:14,767
un az men iz arayngekumen hot getrofn nokh a mentshn "ver bistu?"

459
00:22:15,364 --> 00:22:16,876
shoyn nisht getoygt.

460
00:22:16,933 --> 00:22:19,967
iz eyn mol hot men mikh getrofn bay der nakht in bet,

461
00:22:19,967 --> 00:22:21,820
dos UNK arumgeganen bay der nakht

462
00:22:21,827 --> 00:22:24,825
un zey gezen mikh lign in bet mit a tokhter.

463
00:22:26,485 --> 00:22:27,846
"ver iz dos?"

464
00:22:28,020 --> 00:22:29,296
a CIOTKA,

465
00:22:29,927 --> 00:22:33,464
a CIOTKA gekumen bazukhn vayl di froy iz im geshtorbn.

466
00:22:33,555 --> 00:22:37,076
mit di di dos iz geven a shvester zogt zi z'iz kumen mikh

467
00:22:37,504 --> 00:22:40,977
gut s'iz geven zayn a bakante, zey zenen geven VOLKSDEUTSCHEN

468
00:22:40,977 --> 00:22:46,847
ober di VOLKSDEUTSHEN grade iz geven vos hobn mikh gekent zenen geven fun undzer gegnt.

469
00:22:47,055 --> 00:22:49,307
ikh bin dokh azoy vayt geganen.

470
00:22:49,307 --> 00:22:52,483
shtelt aykh for, tsvey, dray nekht hob ikh gekont geyn.

471
00:22:54,160 --> 00:22:57,124
un ikh bin dort ahingekumen UNK tsu dem goy.

472
00:22:58,108 --> 00:22:59,266
ober s'iz

473
00:22:59,408 --> 00:23:02,307
tsu morgns s'hot ⟨dokh⟩ hob ikh shoyn gemuzt avekgeyn.

474
00:23:02,307 --> 00:23:05,733
hot men mikh shoyn avekgefirt, hot men mikh gefirt tsu zayns vider a

475
00:23:05,733 --> 00:23:08,363
a CIOTKA, a rikhtike CIOTKA.

476
00:23:08,571 --> 00:23:11,959
ober m'iz geganen arum bay der nakht, m'ot nisht getort.

477
00:23:11,959 --> 00:23:13,722
ven zey viln mikh zen

478
00:23:13,722 --> 00:23:16,074
zey kenen UNK mikh UNK derkent.

479
00:23:17,633 --> 00:23:21,317
bin ikh, hob ikh ge-, hobn zey f- fun dort UNK mikh shoyn ⟨oykh⟩

480
00:23:21,317 --> 00:23:22,841
genumen nokh Daytshland.

481
00:23:22,678 --> 00:23:26,275
vi arum hot men dos organizirt az me zol UNK opnemen keyn Daytshland?

482
00:23:25,648 --> 00:23:29,003
UNK neyn, m'iz gekumen nokh ⟨mittsuforn⟩

483
00:23:29,003 --> 00:23:31,599
an eso- ⟨s'iz⟩ esesovnik

484
00:23:32,398 --> 00:23:33,641
fun di

485
00:23:32,432 --> 00:23:34,906
ah gevust az ir ⟨zent⟩ dortn?

486
00:23:34,592 --> 00:23:35,733
yo,

487
00:23:35,757 --> 00:23:40,341
ba- zeyers a zun iz dort gevezn in Daytshland bay zey oyf arbet.

488
00:23:40,600 --> 00:23:44,627
undz hot er gezogt "bay undz iz do a CIOCIA fun a Varshe

489
00:23:44,751 --> 00:23:46,711
vos iz gekumen tsu undz"

490
00:23:46,711 --> 00:23:50,588
zi kon kumen, UNK du vilst konst tsukumen vayl er hot gedarft tsu emetsn

491
00:23:50,588 --> 00:23:51,430
tsu der arbet.

492
00:23:51,430 --> 00:23:53,301
iz er gekumen

493
00:23:53,475 --> 00:23:54,931
un er hot mikh genumen.

494
00:23:54,931 --> 00:23:56,822
an esesovnik.

495
00:23:56,822 --> 00:23:59,092
un er hot mikh aheymgenumen tsu zikh.

496
00:23:59,092 --> 00:24:02,531
ober nokh befor, hob ikh nokh mayne z- mayne kinder

497
00:24:02,858 --> 00:24:04,804
ah ayngeordnt.

498
00:24:04,804 --> 00:24:06,854
iz do ⟨vu⟩ ikh bin gevezn

499
00:24:06,854 --> 00:24:10,310
bay dem goy hob ikh gege⟨UNK⟩ arayn mayn tokhter di eltere.

500
00:24:11,194 --> 00:24:13,798
az oykh nisht ⟨gelozt⟩ tsu lang oyf a plats.

501
00:24:13,798 --> 00:24:17,890
dos iz geven shlekht vos zenen geven tsu lang oyf a plats. es hot nisht getoygt.

502
00:24:17,890 --> 00:24:19,980
m'hot gemuzt toyshn di pletser.

503
00:24:21,437 --> 00:24:25,180
un di, un di yingere iz geven vider oyf an andern plats,

504
00:24:25,180 --> 00:24:26,413
⟨bay⟩ a goy.

505
00:24:26,413 --> 00:24:28,497
iz zey hobn ⟨zi⟩ dort zeyer lib gehat,

506
00:24:28,497 --> 00:24:31,243
zey hobn nisht, zey hobn nisht gevust az s'iz a yidish kind.

507
00:24:31,243 --> 00:24:34,040
s'hot geheysn, zey hobn nisht ⟨gevust laydn⟩, zey hobn yo gevust.

508
00:24:34,040 --> 00:24:35,927
zey hob nisht gevolt dos visn.

509
00:24:36,085 --> 00:24:38,728
vayl s'iz geven beser az zey zoln nisht visn.

510
00:24:38,818 --> 00:24:42,136
hot oykhet eyne zi ibergefirt dort ahin.

511
00:24:42,885 --> 00:24:45,956
un dort iz zi geven di gantse baleboste,

512
00:24:45,956 --> 00:24:48,400
shtelt aykh for, zi hot geshtanen bay der nakht.

513
00:24:48,400 --> 00:24:50,777
⟨un s'iz⟩ geven etlekhe ku,

514
00:24:50,777 --> 00:24:51,803
un s'iz geven ferd,

515
00:24:51,803 --> 00:24:54,425
un zi hot ge⟨UNK⟩ tsum ⟨frestn⟩ di ki mit di ferd

516
00:24:54,425 --> 00:24:56,801
a meydl fun tsen yor.

517
00:24:57,499 --> 00:24:59,909
iz zi oyfgeshtanen bay der nakht far tog

518
00:24:59,909 --> 00:25:02,617
un oyfge- in a brune, veyst vos iz a brune?

519
00:25:02,617 --> 00:25:07,195
hot zi aroysgetrogn, d- geshlept dos vaser, ⟨er⟩ hot ⟨tsu⟩ ge⟨unk⟩ tsu trinken.

520
00:25:07,337 --> 00:25:10,706
a kind fun tsen yor hot dos geton.

521
00:25:12,028 --> 00:25:15,451
der goy hot zi mir nisht gevolt gebn. ikh hob gezen di tsore

522
00:25:15,451 --> 00:25:19,227
un ikh hob shoyn ge- demolt gehaltn bay veg nokh Daytshland

523
00:25:19,227 --> 00:25:22,451
zog ikh "kh'vil aynordenen di kinder a bisl beser"

524
00:25:22,744 --> 00:25:26,737
hob ikh gehat a plats far ir. ikh hob ir shoyn oysgezukht a plats.

525
00:25:27,553 --> 00:25:30,064
ikh bin gekumen do tsum goy nisht visndik

526
00:25:30,064 --> 00:25:32,542
ikh hob nisht gevust ⟨vu⟩ der goy, ⟨mayn⟩ lebn,

527
00:25:32,768 --> 00:25:36,255
⟨vu vu⟩ bin ikh dort a mol gevezn, ver iz dort geven.

528
00:25:37,476 --> 00:25:41,250
kh'hob getrofn arayn ⟨tsu⟩ UNK, kh'hob zi oysgezukht.

529
00:25:41,357 --> 00:25:43,713
bay der nakht iz zi mit mir geshlofn.

530
00:25:43,770 --> 00:25:45,897
zi hot nisht g- g- g- di ⟨geheyme⟩

531
00:25:45,897 --> 00:25:49,192
on ge- gemeynt az s'iz nisht. ikh hob mikh, ikh bin arayngekumen

532
00:25:49,192 --> 00:25:51,274
iz zi gezesn baym oyvn hot ge-

533
00:25:51,313 --> 00:25:54,530
hot geheytst d- d- di ⟨kakhele⟩

534
00:25:54,553 --> 00:25:58,550
iz zi gezesn hot zi zikh nisht umgekukt oyf mir, zi hot mikh nisht gezen

535
00:25:58,550 --> 00:26:00,625
⟨gemakht zeevdik⟩ az zi zet mikh nisht

536
00:26:00,625 --> 00:26:02,574
vayl z'iz geven dort tsufridn.

537
00:26:02,574 --> 00:26:06,856
zi hot gearbet ober z'iz geven tsufridn, zi hot nisht keyn moyre gehat.

538
00:26:05,657 --> 00:26:06,579
⟨aha⟩

539
00:26:06,856 --> 00:26:08,401
zi hot dokh gevust vos iz.

540
00:26:09,184 --> 00:26:10,831
ho- hot zi nisht gevolt

541
00:26:11,648 --> 00:26:16,504
oysgebn zikh, zi hot gemeynt efsher bin ikh gekumen do tsu blaybn, oyb ikh vil do zayn

542
00:26:16,504 --> 00:26:18,563
iz zi hot zikh nisht oysgegebn.

543
00:26:18,563 --> 00:26:21,272
ober di goyim UNK aleyn ⟨dokh⟩ farshtanen.

544
00:26:21,272 --> 00:26:25,412
un zey hobn zi arayngenumen in di andere shtub, un zey hobn gezogt "zogt dem ⟨gevorn⟩,

545
00:26:25,468 --> 00:26:27,014
⟨hob⟩ nisht keyn moyre,

546
00:26:27,358 --> 00:26:28,840
ver iz di froy?

547
00:26:28,840 --> 00:26:31,447
ikh ze az dos iz, veyst ver zi iz"

548
00:26:31,447 --> 00:26:34,435
zogt zi "ikh veys nisht". z'iz geven zeyer a diskretn

549
00:26:34,435 --> 00:26:37,562
zi hot ge- opgeleygt az zi veys nisht ver ikh bin.

550
00:26:38,715 --> 00:26:40,227
un bay sof

551
00:26:40,386 --> 00:26:44,956
hob ikh zi gezogt. vayl ikh hob gezen vos dort tut zikh

552
00:26:44,956 --> 00:26:47,808
hob ikh ge- ⟨geklert⟩ az s'vet zayn gut

553
00:26:47,808 --> 00:26:49,074
UNK tsu blaybn.

554
00:26:49,074 --> 00:26:52,495
s'vet nisht zayn gut hob ikh zi vu tsu nemen

555
00:26:52,495 --> 00:26:57,441
hob ikh gezen az s'iz nisht gut, kh'hob gezen vi zi shteyt bay der ⟨nakht oyf⟩ un zi geyt

556
00:26:57,784 --> 00:27:00,866
di ferd tsu ⟨fresn⟩ mit di, mit di beheymes.

557
00:27:01,345 --> 00:27:03,752
un un ales s'iz zog ikh

558
00:27:05,260 --> 00:27:07,819
hob ikh tsu ir gezogt ⟨zog ikh zog⟩

559
00:27:08,280 --> 00:27:10,417
bay der nakht, zaynen geshlofn

560
00:27:11,402 --> 00:27:12,864
⟨"vi zet oys?"⟩

561
00:27:13,933 --> 00:27:16,998
"ikh bin zikher" zogt zi "ikh bin dokh zikher az m'et lebn

562
00:27:17,207 --> 00:27:20,087
kh'bin dokh shoyn do sh- shoyn dort efsher a yor tsayt".

563
00:27:20,087 --> 00:27:24,069
makht zi ⟨"ikh bin dokh zikher⟩ UNK mame UNK"

564
00:27:25,223 --> 00:27:27,430
"vi iz? vos hert zikh?" hob ikh oykh gezogt

565
00:27:27,430 --> 00:27:29,098
"ikh for nokh Daytshland"

566
00:27:29,678 --> 00:27:32,282
"ikh vil" zog ikh "az du vest fun do aroys

567
00:27:32,282 --> 00:27:34,751
UNK do mer nisht zayn"

568
00:27:39,313 --> 00:27:43,677
ikh hob zi mitgenumen, ir veyst az der got mit di goyim zey hobn nisht gevolt gebn.

569
00:27:44,207 --> 00:27:46,918
"zi iz in der rekhter hant" hobn zey gezogt.

570
00:27:48,055 --> 00:27:50,445
"zi tut ales" zi hot gekokht,

571
00:27:50,518 --> 00:27:52,039
un zi hot geroymt,

572
00:27:52,039 --> 00:27:55,974
un zi hot a- d- geganen fun feld ⟨tsu⟩getrogn tsu esn,

573
00:27:55,974 --> 00:27:58,392
ales a kind fun tsen yor.

574
00:27:59,682 --> 00:28:02,297
un azoy iz geven, un ikh un ikh hob zi genumen.

575
00:28:02,297 --> 00:28:04,316
bizn hayntikn tog veysn zey nisht,

576
00:28:05,385 --> 00:28:08,366
fun gornisht. vayl vos hob ikh shoyn gehat mit zey?

577
00:28:08,507 --> 00:28:09,753
kh'hob zi genumen

578
00:28:09,753 --> 00:28:11,001
un dos iz es.

579
00:28:11,001 --> 00:28:14,705
ven zey voltn zi ge- bahandlt vi me bahandlt a kind

580
00:28:14,705 --> 00:28:18,916
⟨vi⟩ me dos, zi hot gedarft ⟨oyf tsu shoyn bay der⟩ nakht gebn tsu esn

581
00:28:18,916 --> 00:28:21,799
far di beheymes? a kind fun tsen yor?

582
00:28:22,075 --> 00:28:25,511
un a, di brune iz geven f- ongefroyrn

583
00:28:25,517 --> 00:28:30,286
zi hot geshlept aroyf dos vaser, di kibeles mitn vaser fun di brune?

584
00:28:30,394 --> 00:28:32,895
hob ikh zi gedarft dort ibertsulozn

585
00:28:32,895 --> 00:28:34,361
kh'hob gehat zi ⟨vu⟩ tsu nemen

586
00:28:34,361 --> 00:28:36,193
kh'hob zi UNK ⟨eltere⟩

587
00:28:36,317 --> 00:28:39,213
bay g- gute goyim, vos ikh hob gevust az zenen.

588
00:28:39,321 --> 00:28:40,440
shoyn dos iz.

589
00:28:40,440 --> 00:28:41,879
un ikh bin take avek.

590
00:28:41,970 --> 00:28:45,221
iz beyde kinder zenen geven bay dem zelbn goy?

591
00:28:44,629 --> 00:28:45,975
neyn, eyne.

592
00:28:45,975 --> 00:28:48,565
un eyne iz geven bay dem vos ikh bin gevezn

593
00:28:48,565 --> 00:28:50,084
bay dem vos hot gezogt

594
00:28:49,851 --> 00:28:52,713
a der vos hot gevust az ir zent a yidishe.

595
00:28:50,084 --> 00:28:50,925
⟨az⟩

596
00:28:52,062 --> 00:28:56,258
yo, bay undz, un yo, un naher hob ikh hob ikh ⟨do oykh⟩ oysgezogt.

597
00:28:56,483 --> 00:28:57,728
azoy iz es.

598
00:28:57,728 --> 00:29:01,208
un ikh hob gezogt, zogt ⟨er⟩ me makht zi "far vos vilstu zi nemen?"

599
00:29:01,208 --> 00:29:03,365
zog ikh "kh'vil zi nemen

600
00:29:03,365 --> 00:29:06,011
vayl ikh vil az ⟨zi⟩ zol zikh zen mit di shvester"

601
00:29:06,287 --> 00:29:10,154
un er hot er hot gezogt "ikh UNK"

602
00:29:10,154 --> 00:29:12,264
zi nemen fun vanen zi iz

603
00:29:12,264 --> 00:29:15,697
ikh zol es, ⟨nokh⟩ gut, kh'hob gegebn tsu visn

604
00:29:16,429 --> 00:29:18,009
mer hobn UNK shoyn nisht

605
00:29:18,893 --> 00:29:22,939
kh'hob gezen az zi a zi hot nisht gehat gut, un ikh hob gekont UNK farbesern

606
00:29:22,939 --> 00:29:24,416
hob ikh UNK farbesert.

607
00:29:24,416 --> 00:29:26,484
un naher, shtelt aykh for,

608
00:29:26,484 --> 00:29:29,653
der esesovnik UNK ⟨hot⟩ mikh genumen nokh Daytshland

609
00:29:29,811 --> 00:29:31,579
un ikh bin geven bay im,

610
00:29:31,579 --> 00:29:34,901
hot a shkheyne gezogt efsher veys ikh fun emetsn

611
00:29:34,924 --> 00:29:36,808
zi darf oykhet a mentsh.

612
00:29:37,017 --> 00:29:39,221
zog ikh "ikh hob a tokhter".

613
00:29:39,379 --> 00:29:41,561
kh'hob gevolt di tokhter zol kumen.

614
00:29:41,561 --> 00:29:44,587
vayl dortn nisht geven shlekht bay zey, ⟨zey hobn⟩ UNK

615
00:29:43,615 --> 00:29:45,803
vu iz dos geven, in velkhn plats?

616
00:29:45,859 --> 00:29:47,422
in Daytshland?

617
00:29:45,960 --> 00:29:50,358
in OSTPREISSEN, ikh gedenk nisht vu, s'iz UNK

618
00:29:49,386 --> 00:29:52,552
vos iz in tsvishn geshen mit ayer shvester?

619
00:29:52,761 --> 00:29:55,590
mit di shvester, zi iz geblibn bay di goyim.

620
00:29:55,782 --> 00:29:57,818
bay di goyim hot men zi gekhapt.

621
00:29:57,992 --> 00:29:59,356
mitn yingele

622
00:29:59,089 --> 00:29:59,960
ye.

623
00:30:00,777 --> 00:30:02,627
neyn! nisht mitn yingele

624
00:30:02,650 --> 00:30:05,524
m'hot zi gekhapt zi, un me hot tsuge-

625
00:30:05,524 --> 00:30:06,921
tsugenumen ⟨nisht⟩

